flowchart TD
  A[Base Commit] --> D{Compare AssetId & Revisions}
  L[Left Commit] --> D
  R[Right Commit] --> D
  D --> C{Only one side changed?}
  C -->|Yes| F[Fast-forward selected AssetRevision]
  C -->|No| K{MediaAdapter explicitly supports safe 3-way merge?}
  K -->|Yes| T[Adapter safe merge with parents and provenance]
  K -->|No| H[Manual conflict review, keep both revisions]
  T --> V{Validate merged manifest + all receipts}
  H --> V
  F --> V
  V -->|Valid| P[Publish GitGit Merge Commit with Ref CAS]
  V -->|Invalid| X[Reject, preserve parents and old Ref]
